    "answer": {
      "short": "8 times",
      "worked": "Doubling both base dimensions multiplies the base area by $2\\times2=4$. The height also doubles.\n$$\\begin{align*}V_{\\text{original}}&=Ah\\\\V_{\\text{new}}&=(4A)(2h)\\\\V_{\\text{new}}&=8Ah\\\\V_{\\text{new}}&=8V_{\\text{original}}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
